# Model weights. These are large binaries; two copies of an 81 MB resnet34
# checkpoint were committed once already and are permanent in history now.
# Share weights through Drive, the same way the data is shared.
#
# Anchored to the repo root (leading slash) on purpose: an unanchored
# `models/` also matches src/models/, which silently excluded
# src/models/final_model.py and src/models/baseline_models.py from every
# commit ever made, despite both being imported throughout the codebase.
/models/
*.pth
*.pt
*.h5
*.ckpt
